# "During any turn you attacked with a Rogue" asks about the declaration (CR 508.1), not about who controls the Rogue now.
# Bot2's Old Man of the Sea, free to tap since turn 4, takes Robber of the Rich in response to its attack trigger on turn 5.
# Bot1 still attacked with a Rogue this turn, so Bot1 casts the exiled Lightning Bolt with Mox Pearl's white mana.
